    <string name="about_body">PhoneLab gives you full real-time visibility into your device\'s hardware.\n\n✅  17 live hardware sensors\n✅  8 thermal zones (CPU, GPU, Battery, Modem, WiFi, Charger, NPU, Skin)\n✅  Full device specifications &amp; export to file\n✅  Multi-phase performance benchmark\n✅  GPS speed &amp; altitude tracking\n✅  Live compass + sound-level meter\n✅  Textual &amp; Visual display modes\n✅  Metric / Imperial units\n✅  Dark &amp; Light themes</string>
